  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the hot-stone-plate until it reaches 200°C.",
    "Heat oil in a shallow pan over medium heat and sauté shallots and garlic until fragrant.",
    "Add dried thyme and stir for 30 seconds.",
    "Pour in white wine, deglaze the pan and let reduce by half.",
    "Stir in lemon juice, mustard, and capers, then whisk in heavy cream until smooth.",
    "Place the kippers on the heated stone plate, cover with the sauce and let simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the plate from heat and sprinkle with fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately with crusty bread or boiled potatoes."
